# Rule Title

One sentence stating the scope of this rule.

## Rule

State each constraint as a "must" or "must not". Be specific enough that two
agents would make the same decision.

## Why

Explain the failure this rule prevents. Reference the real bug or requirement.

## How to apply

- Concrete step or check.
